  "description": "<p>Add a personalized touch to your boat, dock, or marina with this custom anchor doormat. Featuring a unique nautical design, this welcome mat is ideal for yacht owners, fishing boats, or anyone who enjoys a coastal lifestyle. Crafted for both visual appeal and durability, it enhances any marine-themed setting while offering comfort underfoot.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with boat name, family name, or location</li>\n<li>Features vibrant maritime colors and anchor designs</li>\n<li>Combines visual charm with comfort and durability</li>\n<li>Equipped with anti-slip pads for secure placement</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain for high-traffic areas</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Repellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Nautical 04</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is suitable for cabins, ships, yachts, fishing boats, docks, marina entries, and coastal homes, serving as a welcoming accent for both indoor and outdoor spaces.</p>",
